  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:22",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "相談しようと思ったら{n}コジマはこう言ったの。",
  "en": "I was going to talk to you.{n}But then you said this, Kojima.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:23",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "七海、おまえちょっと太ったぞ。{n}悩みなんてないんだろう、って。",
  "en": "\"Nanami, you've gotten a bit fat.{n}You must not have a care in the world.\"",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:24",
  "hdr": "0023 0011",
  "jp": "……悪かった。{n}もう1回相談してくれ。",
  "en": "...I'm sorry.{n}Give me another chance. Talk to me.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:25",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "コジマに相談しても{n}どうしようもない。",
  "en": "Talking to you won't{n}change anything, Kojima.",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:26",
  "hdr": "0007 000F",
  "jp": "子供は親について行くしか{n}ないじゃない！",
  "en": "Kids have no choice but to go{n}where their parents go!",
  "status": "done",
  "notes": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "2600:27",
  "hdr": "0023 0011",
  "jp": "そんなことない！{n}ふたりで作戦を考えよう！",
